/-! Finite reset semigroups generated by the rank-two Schur channels.
A diagonal density gives time composition, GNS symmetry and Hamiltonian covariance.
A faithful density and a positive reset rate give positivity improvement and mixing. -/

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

open Matrix
